머신 러닝을 융합해 여러분을 더 빠르고 정확한 사수로 만들어 줍니다.","supported_languages":"영어, 스페인어 - 스페인, 스페인어 - 중남미, 포르투갈어 - 브라질, 프랑스어, 이탈리아어, 독일어, 일본어, 한국어, 폴란드어, 러시아어, 중국어 간체, 태국어, 중국어 번체, 튀르키예어","reviews":"“After just 90 minutes with a beta version of the software, I learned that I perform better with pistols and tend to overaim when moving my cursor left to right. According to Aim Lab ’s internal metrics, I raised my pistol accuracy from 67 percent to 77 percent and my rifle accuracy from 28 percent (yes, I’m that bad) to 60 percent. That feels like a dramatic improvement for a casual player using a beta version of the software for less than two hours.”<br>Motherboard<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/714010\/header.jpg?t=1782227933","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/714010\/357d48a63421b01245ebdfda99791e5e4cc6140e\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782227933","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/714010\/357d48a63421b01245ebdfda99791e5e4cc6140e\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782227933","website":"https:\/\/www.aimlabs.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8\/10<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo E6600 or AMD Phenom™ X3 8750 processor or better<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GTX 560 and up<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 12 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8\/10<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo E6600 or AMD Phenom™ X3 8750 processor or better<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GTX 560 and up<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong>